[Opening "Other replies to 1.d4"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 c6 2. e4 {Take the whole center. Now it's the Caro-Kann from your 1.e4 lines.} d5 3. e5 {Same as in vs Caro-Kann: grab space.} *

[Event "1...d6: play 2.e4 – it's the Pirc"]
[Opening "Other replies to 1.d4"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 d6 2. e4 {Take the whole center. Now it's the Pirc from your 1.e4 lines.} Nf6 3. Nc3 {Protect e4, like in vs Pirc.} *

[Event "1...g6: play 2.e4 – it's the Modern"]
[Opening "Other replies to 1.d4"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 g6 2. e4 {Take the whole center. Now it's the Modern from your 1.e4 lines.} Bg7 3. Nc3 {Develop, like in vs Modern.} *
